; W2 ReviewRuntime[0]: a huge `distance=..R` box overflowed the section-count estimate (long product went
; negative), so the selection probed every section position and hung the server. Larger radii
; throw in vanilla too (SectionPos range), which the differential run compares.
@setup
objective create t dummy

@function run
summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["mcfc_huge_d"]}
execute store result score a t if entity @e[tag=mcfc_huge_d,distance=..17000000]
execute store result score b t if entity @e[tag=mcfc_huge_d,distance=..30000000]
execute store result score c t if entity @e[tag=mcfc_huge_d,distance=..99999999]
kill @e[tag=mcfc_huge_d]

@validate
score a t is 1
; vanilla aborts the function at `b` with the same exception; the compiled function is switched to vanilla there
allow_runtime_error
